   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Today: 6 imports of private names of config.sizing (_AutoSize x5, _encode_sizable x1) from energy_system (5) and setup_rules (1):\nviolations of the public-API rule.\nConfig names imported today by face: components declaration 281, identity 49, construction 0; energy_system construction 23,\ndeclaration 25, identity 15; setup_rules construction 5, declaration 5; cli construction 4; postprocessing 2 (capex_computation:\ncutover).",
   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Today: 6 imports of private names of config.sizing (_AutoSize x5, _encode_sizable x1) from energy_system (5) and setup_rules (1):\nviolations of the public-API rule.\nConfig names imported today by face: components declaration 281, identity 49, construction 0; energy_system construction 23,\ndeclaration 25, identity 15; setup_rules construction 5, declaration 5; cli construction 4; postprocessing 2 (capex_computation:\ncutover).",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
