   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Inside components today, 90 statements (107\nnames): configuration 27 (17 cutover, 8\nPhysicsConfig: leaf, 1 DHW demand: shared\ncode), dual-circuit parts 11 (subcomponents) and\ntypes 6 (shared code),\nheating_curve: EmitterDesign 1 (subcomponents),\nHeatDistributionSystemType 2 (shared code); one\nfamily 10 (car, LPG: folders; LpgLocalTime and\nthe handover types: shared code); another\ncomponent's class 50 (stay red); + 24 importlib\ncalls.",
   "fontSize": 10,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
